{
  "name": "Buttons",
  "kind": "component",
  "category": "elements",
  "slug": "elements/buttons",
  "docsUrl": "https://bestax.io/docs/api/elements/buttons",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Default Button Group",
      "code": "<Buttons>\n  <Button color=\"primary\">Save</Button>\n  <Button color=\"info\">Edit</Button>\n  <Button color=\"danger\">Delete</Button>\n</Buttons>"
    },
    {
      "title": "All Colors Group",
      "code": "<Buttons>\n  {['primary', 'link', 'info', 'success', 'warning', 'danger'].map(color => (\n    <Button key={color} color={color}>\n      {color.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + color.slice(1)}\n    </Button>\n  ))}\n</Buttons>"
    },
    {
      "title": "All Sizes Group",
      "code": "<Buttons>\n  {['small', 'normal', 'medium', 'large'].map(size => (\n    <Button key={size} size={size}>\n      {size.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + size.slice(1)}\n    </Button>\n  ))}\n</Buttons>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Add-ons (No Spacing Between Buttons)",
      "code": "<Buttons hasAddons>\n  <Button color=\"primary\">Left</Button>\n  <Button color=\"primary\">Center</Button>\n  <Button color=\"primary\">Right</Button>\n</Buttons>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Centered Group",
      "code": "<Buttons isCentered>\n  <Button color=\"info\">One</Button>\n  <Button color=\"info\">Two</Button>\n</Buttons>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Right-Aligned Group",
      "code": "<Buttons isRight>\n  <Button color=\"success\">Accept</Button>\n  <Button color=\"danger\">Reject</Button>\n</Buttons>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Compound (dot-notation) usage",
      "code": "<Buttons>\n  <Buttons.Button color=\"primary\">Save</Buttons.Button>\n  <Buttons.Button>Cancel</Buttons.Button>\n  <Buttons.LinkButton>Learn more</Buttons.LinkButton>\n</Buttons>"
    }
  ],
  "accessibility": "- Grouping buttons in a `<div class=\"buttons\">` has no negative impact on accessibility.\n- Ensure each `Button` has a clear label (text or `aria-label`).\n- If grouping radio or toggle buttons, consider `aria-pressed` or `aria-checked` for stateful controls.\n\n:::tip\nYou can use all Bulma helper props (spacing, color, alignment) with `Buttons` for even more control.\n:::",
  "related": ["Button", "useBulmaClasses"],
